## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to design a practical CV pipeline using lightweight, non-ML methods for a common task.

## Key Concepts
- Circle detection with Hough transform
- Radius-based grouping for coin types
- Noise/shadow handling with blur and histogram equalization
- Validation with synthetic data

## Code Example
